{"availability":"available","full":"Nipheon/kitCreatorMove","name":"kitCreatorMove","description":"Kit Creator for Ableton Move","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-12T11:18:59Z","updated":"2026-10-08T18:27:44Z","license":"0BSD","branch":"main","homepage":"https://move-kit-creator.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://move-kit-creator.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.782Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.782Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.782Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.782Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A fast, browser-based web application that turns your drum sample libraries into hardware-ready Ableton Move preset bundles (.ablpresetbundle)."],"features":["📁 Folder Drag & Drop: Drop sample folders directly into the browser, or use Pick folders / Pick files where dragging is not possible (a phone, say). Some mobile browsers only offer a file picker for folders; use Pick…","🗂️ Collections: A dropped folder that holds several independent packs (Kit 1 ... Kit 7, a set of named banks) is listed as a parent with its sub-packs as child rows. Tick the parent to use everything, or tick only some…","🎯 Smart Classification: Detects sample roles (Kick, Snare, Closed Hat, Open Hat, Clap, Crash, Percussion, Other) from filenames and folder names, tuned against real sample libraries. A hat with no open/closed qualifier…","🧹 Loop & Non-Drum Filtering: Leaves out loops (a bar count, a tempo like 128bpm, or a filename saying \"break\" on a file it could not otherwise categorise) and uncategorised material that looks like effects, vocals,…","🎛️ Derived 4×4 Pad Grid: The grid is built from the categories your library actually holds rather than picked from a fixed list. Up to four categories take a full-height column each; a fifth and beyond share the top…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nipheon/kitCreatorMove/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cd748fb3903cae5125bcd477eff2e8d46855325fc34bb1660e682d9ddee4d06e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.920Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.920Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A fast, browser-based web application that turns your drum sample libraries into hardware-ready Ableton Move preset bundles (.ablpresetbundle).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nipheon/kitCreatorMove/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cd748fb3903cae5125bcd477eff2e8d46855325fc34bb1660e682d9ddee4d06e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nipheon/kitCreatorMove/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.920Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T18:27:44Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nipheon/kitCreatorMove/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.921Z","hash":"cd748fb3903cae5125bcd477eff2e8d46855325fc34bb1660e682d9ddee4d06e","originalBytes":11618,"storedBytes":11618,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kit","grid","closed","open","sample","folder","pad","pads","file","folders","only","hats","npm","when","drum","files","hat","one","percussion","app","categories","credits","drop","each","every","export","four","library","pick","public","see","test","type","bash","batch","browser","classification","derived","icon","icon.png","kick","ksho","license","like","move","never","other","out","parent","preview","rows","single","trimming","wav","ableton","agents.md","analytics","another","audition","before","build","derivation","drawn","eye","kind","lock","name","preset","read","reroll","row","run","same","samples","shows","silence","snare","some","source","sub-packs","tests","them","tick","top","wavs","web","ablpresetbundle","actually","adpcm","any","application","attribution","available.","batch.zip","bit","both","bsd","built","bundle","bundles","button","categorise","category.","ccpp","choke","choking","clap","clone","cloud